+"""arqux-domain-software — compatibility pack for 0.7.x projects.
+
+This is the **only** domain pack the kernel ships with. It packages
+all the 0.7.x software-specific behaviour (templates, workflows,
+identities, skills, lenses, semantic CORTEX schema) so existing
+projects can load under 0.8 unchanged.
+
+Per ADR-001: this pack IS the compatibility. Removing it removes
+the ability to load any 0.7.x project.
+"""
+
